    "en": "Step into a twisted 80s-inspired world full of dark secrets, haunted graveyards, and supernatural threats. Travel trough the board and explore the different areas. Battle your way through the board. The tougher the foe, the better the rewards. Trick, trap, or take them down... but beware, they’ll do the same to you. Hunt down hidden crystals across the board. No crystals, no final fight. Only one can claim victory. Will you have the most crystals? Game features: Multiplayer PVP Multiplayer PVE Boardgame aesthetics Horror satirical elements Turn-based gameplay Original music Custom cards and boardgame Skin customization Tabletop vibes Multiple levels P2P hosting solution Multiple Events"
